143:and now the summation is done along the first dimension of the bracketed matrix indicates the 𝑖 -th slice of a matrix. By adopting the proposed approach, the model can be efficiently parameterized with M order-3 tensors, as opposed to implementing sets of vectors as described in Equation 2. This modification not only enhances the overall efficiency but also decouples different modalities in the simplified calculation of h, enabling seamless extension of the approach to any number of modalities.
